Switch 2 video decoder: the commands of later SDKs (upstream Eglantine 1b726d93c5).

The decoder service also takes 201 and 202 (initialize with a fourth u32, and with a further u64),
210 (copy handle and four u32, only a result back) and 400 (a frame like 109, plus a 0x838-byte
information block after it; SubmitInput finds its data words after however many A descriptors the
request has). gsv 905(u8) opens the decoder's creator session like 902.

Mario Kart World sends 201 when a race loads: it was unimplemented, and the game froze on the
course intro before the race started.

